// English screen text, by key (ADR-0045). Screens ask for it with
// `ctx.text("title.new_game")`. Keys are `screen.thing`: lowercase letters,
// digits, `_` and `.`.
//
// `{Confirm}`, `{Cancel}`, `{Cursor}` and the other action names become
// the player's keys (never write a key's name here); any other `{name}` is
// a value the screen fills in.
